WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.375
<b>Now here,</b>

2
00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:38.333
<b>Arjuna is asking a natural question,</b>

3
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:41.125
<b>which may have also arisen in your mind.</b>

4
00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:46.750
<b>This not only reflects how attentively Arjuna </b>
<b>was listening to Lord Krishna's words,</b>

5
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.916
<b>but also gives a glimpse of </b>
<b>their mutual relationship.</b>

6
00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:51.750
<b>Arjuna</b>

7
00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:56.041
<b>is not only a devotee of Lord Krishna </b>
<b>but also his friend,</b>

8
00:00:56.041 --> 00:00:59.125
<b>and that is why he asks this question.</b>

9
00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.875
<b>The basis of this question is not disbelief,</b>

10
00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:06.458
<b>but the basis is an intense desire to believe.</b>

11
00:01:06.458 --> 00:01:10.250
<b>As if Arjuna is saying, please give </b>
<b>the answer to this question,</b>

12
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:14.916
<b>so that it does not become an obstacle </b>
<b>in the path of acquiring this knowledge.</b>

13
00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:16.583
<b>What is this question?</b>

14
00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:17.916
<b>Listen ahead.</b>

15
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.541
<b>Here Arjuna asks,</b>

16
00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:25.541
<b>O Krishna,</b>

17
00:01:25.541 --> 00:01:29.125
<b>you were born after the sun god Vivasvan?</b>

18
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:35.041
<b>Then how was it possible that you </b>
<b>yourself gave him this knowledge of yoga?</b>

19
00:01:35.041 --> 00:01:38.375
<b>It is natural for this question </b>
<b>to arise in Arjuna's mind.</b>

20
00:01:38.375 --> 00:01:42.500
<b>The sun god has existed from </b>
<b>time immemorial of the human race,</b>

21
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:46.791
<b>and both Krishna and Arjuna were born in this era,</b>

22
00:01:46.791 --> 00:01:52.208
<b>so how can it be understood that Lord Krishna </b>
<b>gave this knowledge to the sun god?</b>

23
00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:53.166
<b>Also,</b>

24
00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:58.458
<b>in the last few verses, there was a </b>
<b>mention of Manu and King Ikshvaku,</b>

25
00:01:58.458 --> 00:02:01.375
<b>they were all born before Lord Krishna.</b>

26
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:06.208
<b>This question shows that devotion </b>
<b>does not mean blind faith.</b>

27
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:08.875
<b>Questions can also be asked in devotion,</b>

28
00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:13.625
<b>and if your mind is clear, </b>
<b>their answers will also be found.</b>

29
00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:14.541
<b>Also,</b>

30
00:02:14.541 --> 00:02:18.000
<b>we can understand it from another perspective.</b>

31
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.625
<b>Perhaps Arjuna is asking this question</b>

32
00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:26.291
<b>so that in the future, those who</b>
<b>doubt Krishna's glory,</b>

33
00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:29.666
<b>their doubts will be removed from their minds.</b>

34
00:02:29.666 --> 00:02:33.333
<b>Arjuna is doing good to others through himself.</b>

35
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:35.833
<b>When Lord Krishna will give </b>
<b>the answer to this question,</b>

36
00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:38.750
<b>it will remove the doubt from everyone's mind,</b>

37
00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:44.333
<b>and they will be able to absorb this</b>
<b>knowledge better, to take advantage of it.</b>

38
00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:45.083
<b>Now</b>

39
00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:48.708
<b>some people may also have </b>
<b>another doubt in their mind.</b>

40
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:55.458
<b>Is Lord Krishna praising his own glory </b>
<b>by mentioning the sun god? </b>

41
00:02:55.458 --> 00:02:58.083
<b>Is this self-praise?</b>

42
00:02:58.083 --> 00:02:59.583
<b>Never.</b>

43
00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:03.250
<b>Understand it well, and understand it this way.</b>

44
00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:06.625
<b>If your vehicle breaks down </b>
<b>somewhere while going somewhere,</b>

45
00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:09.750
<b>you are standing on </b>
<b>the roadside getting troubled,</b>

46
00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:14.791
<b>and just then someone comes</b>
<b>to you and says that I am proficient in this work,</b>

47
00:03:14.791 --> 00:03:17.625
<b>come let me help you.</b>

48
00:03:17.625 --> 00:03:20.208
<b>So is this self-praise?</b>

49
00:03:20.208 --> 00:03:21.333
<b>Not at all.</b>

50
00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:24.416
<b>Here the goal is to help you,</b>

51
00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:30.458
<b>and also to assure you that </b>
<b>now you are in the right hands.</b>

52
00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:35.000
<b>In this Gita, wherever Lord Krishna </b>
<b>tells about himself,</b>

53
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.166
<b>his purpose is also the same,</b>

54
00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:41.125
<b>to help you, to remove your doubts.</b>

55
00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:45.666
<b>Never make the mistake of understanding </b>
<b>it as glorification.Keep this in mind.</b>

56
00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:55.458
<b>Arjuna is clearly asking a question here.</b>

57
00:03:55.458 --> 00:04:04.083
<b>From this, you can definitely learn an </b>
<b>important perspective of personal life.</b>

58
00:04:04.083 --> 00:04:11.500
<b>Do you just accept any information</b>
<b>without examining it?</b>

59
00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:17.666
<b>Or do you also raise questions about the </b>
<b>facts and sources of that information?</b>

60
00:04:17.666 --> 00:04:19.250
<b>In today's era,</b>

61
00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:27.041
<b>humans constantly face numerous messages,</b>
<b>suggestions, and advertisements.</b>

62
00:04:27.041 --> 00:04:28.583
<b>Take your phone,</b>

63
00:04:28.583 --> 00:04:31.666
<b>or the TV kept in your house?</b>

64
00:04:31.666 --> 00:04:40.291
<b>Many popular stars, many famous people</b>
<b>keep giving you numerous messages.</b>

65
00:04:40.291 --> 00:04:45.791
<b>Do you think rationally about all those things,</b>

66
00:04:45.791 --> 00:04:48.541
<b>or do you just believe them?</b>

67
00:04:48.541 --> 00:04:50.458
<b>For example,</b>

68
00:04:50.458 --> 00:04:59.291
<b>when a famous person on TV tells you </b>
<b>to use a particular product or lifestyle,</b>

69
00:04:59.291 --> 00:05:07.000
<b>many people get attracted to that product </b>
<b>and lifestyle under its influence.</b>

70
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:15.416
<b>They don't even try to find out whether</b>
<b>it is beneficial for them or not.</b>

71
00:05:15.416 --> 00:05:20.708
<b>Don't be attracted to any item or advertisement</b>

72
00:05:20.708 --> 00:05:25.958
<b>just because some famous person is seen using it.</b>

73
00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:31.000
<b>Make your own decision on every item you use,</b>

74
00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:36.000
<b>know about that item, examine it, then use it.</b>

75
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.875
<b>Make a cautious decision.</b>

76
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:43.458
<b>The same lesson applies to social norms as well.</b>

77
00:05:43.458 --> 00:05:46.125
<b>It is the prevailing notion in society</b>

78
00:05:46.125 --> 00:05:54.416
<b>that the path to success goes </b>
<b>only through wealth, respect, and fame.</b>

79
00:05:54.416 --> 00:05:59.625
<b>Arjuna's rational thinking inspires us to question:</b>

80
00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:06.958
<b>Is this path of wealth, respect, </b>
<b>and fame truly satisfying?</b>

81
00:06:06.958 --> 00:06:14.166
<b>Does it truly align with our </b>
<b>inner purpose and well-being?</b>

82
00:06:14.166 --> 00:06:16.458
<b>For personal growth,</b>

83
00:06:16.458 --> 00:06:23.625
<b>make it a habit to think rationally</b>
<b>about every thing and belief.</b>

84
00:06:23.625 --> 00:06:25.291
<b>Ask questions:</b>

85
00:06:25.291 --> 00:06:27.541
<b>What benefit do I get from this?</b>

86
00:06:27.541 --> 00:06:33.541
<b>Is this in the interest of my principles </b>
<b>and long-term goals?</b>

87
00:06:33.541 --> 00:06:37.583
<b>Is there any harm to anyone else in this?</b>

88
00:06:37.583 --> 00:06:40.583
<b>By not being influenced by popularity</b>

89
00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:43.416
<b>and forming your own independent thinking,</b>

90
00:06:43.416 --> 00:06:48.416
<b>you will definitely be able to make </b>
<b>the best decisions in your interest.</b>

91
00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.458
<b>I am happy</b>

92
00:06:55.458 --> 00:06:58.208
<b>that Arjuna asked this question.</b>

93
00:06:58.208 --> 00:07:06.625
<b>It reflects his desire to know about </b>
<b>this subject in depth, and his interest.</b>

94
00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:10.291
<b>In the family environment also, </b>
<b>it happens many times</b>

95
00:07:10.291 --> 00:07:15.041
<b>when the youth question traditional practices.</b>

96
00:07:15.041 --> 00:07:18.375
<b>This is a sign of doubt or interest.</b>

97
00:07:18.375 --> 00:07:21.208
<b>Don't consider it rebellion.</b>

98
00:07:21.208 --> 00:07:25.708
<b>Rather, these questions </b>
<b>are a valuable opportunity</b>

99
00:07:25.708 --> 00:07:33.291
<b>through which family traditions </b>
<b>and beliefs can be explained in depth.</b>

100
00:07:33.291 --> 00:07:39.416
<b>Family elders should understand the </b>
<b>curiosity behind these questions,</b>

101
00:07:39.416 --> 00:07:44.375
<b>and explain the logic and rationale behind </b>
<b>every ritual and custom.</b>

102
00:07:44.375 --> 00:07:50.333
<b>This will not only keep traditions</b>
<b>meaningful for new members,</b>

103
00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:51.166
<b>but</b>

104
00:07:51.166 --> 00:07:55.000
<b>family relationships will also be strengthened.</b>

105
00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.291
<b>For example,</b>

106
00:07:57.291 --> 00:08:04.166
<b>when a young member asks during </b>
<b>a family gathering or ceremony,</b>

107
00:08:04.166 --> 00:08:07.250
<b>"Why do we do this?",</b>

108
00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.916
<b>don't evade that question,</b>

109
00:08:09.916 --> 00:08:11.500
<b>don't say that</b>

110
00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.708
<b>"This is how it has always been."</b>

111
00:08:14.708 --> 00:08:15.916
<b>Rather,</b>

112
00:08:15.916 --> 00:08:22.083
<b>take time and explain the importance </b>
<b>of that ceremony to that youth.</b>

113
00:08:22.083 --> 00:08:23.500
<b>Through this process,</b>

114
00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:26.541
<b>not only do young members gain knowledge,</b>

115
00:08:26.541 --> 00:08:29.208
<b>but it may also be possible that</b>

116
00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:31.291
<b>with some suggestion given by them, </b>

117
00:08:31.291 --> 00:08:36.291
<b>you can mold these traditions </b>
<b>according to the modern lifestyle,</b>

118
00:08:36.291 --> 00:08:39.416
<b>and increase their importance even more.</b>

119
00:08:39.416 --> 00:08:42.916
<b>Encouraging open discussions teaches the youth</b>

120
00:08:42.916 --> 00:08:49.583
<b>to respect their cultural</b>
<b>heritage and family legacy.</b>

121
00:08:49.583 --> 00:08:51.041
<b>And finally,</b>

122
00:08:51.041 --> 00:08:54.541
<b>when you respect their questions,</b>

123
00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:59.916
<b>you are indirectly telling them</b>

124
00:08:59.916 --> 00:09:06.166
<b>how important their thoughts </b>
<b>and opinions are to you.</b>

125
00:09:06.166 --> 00:09:10.041
<b>This is a kind of respect for them.</b>

126
00:09:10.041 --> 00:09:14.500
<b>As a result, their love for you increases.</b>

127
00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:21.416
<b>And it is this mutual respect and love that is the foundation of a strong family.</b>

128
00:09:21.416 --> 00:09:23.375
<b>Don't evade questions,</b>

129
00:09:23.375 --> 00:09:25.000
<b>resolve them.</b>

130
00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:29.625
<b>And if this requires you to study as well,</b>

131
00:09:29.625 --> 00:09:32.500
<b>then your knowledge will also increase.</b>

132
00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:35.125
<b>This is in everyone's interest.</b>

133
00:09:35.125 --> 00:09:36.666
<b>Think about it.</b>

134
00:09:41.291 --> 00:09:45.375
<b>Arjuna has asked a rational question.</b>

135
00:09:45.375 --> 00:09:47.708
<b>And this is necessary too.</b>

136
00:09:47.708 --> 00:09:49.083
<b>Similarly,</b>

137
00:09:49.083 --> 00:09:51.708
<b>in any business organization also,</b>

138
00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:59.125
<b>rationally challenging long-standing </b>
<b>processes or rules,</b>

139
00:09:59.125 --> 00:10:04.833
<b>the flow of new ideas, is extremely </b>
<b>essential for that organization.</b>

140
00:10:04.833 --> 00:10:09.125
<b>This is how development </b>
<b>and innovation will happen.</b>

141
00:10:09.125 --> 00:10:10.583
<b>Also,</b>

142
00:10:10.583 --> 00:10:16.333
<b>here Arjuna asked this question </b>
<b>even after being my devotee.</b>

143
00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:19.750
<b>I'm really glad about it as well. </b>

144
00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:24.291
<b>The senior officials of any business </b>
<b>organization</b>

145
00:10:24.291 --> 00:10:30.083
<b>should also create an environment </b>
<b>with their colleagues</b>

146
00:10:30.083 --> 00:10:38.250
<b>where people do not hesitate before asking </b>
<b>any question or giving any new suggestion.</b>

147
00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:42.166
<b>Rather, this should become a process.</b>

148
00:10:42.166 --> 00:10:43.833
<b>For example –</b>

149
00:10:43.833 --> 00:10:51.250
<b>whenever any new product, any new process, </b>
<b>any new technology is to be used,</b>

150
00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:54.125
<b>a group should be formed</b>

151
00:10:54.125 --> 00:10:59.375
<b>where both experienced and </b>
<b>young people of that organization</b>

152
00:10:59.375 --> 00:11:03.916
<b>can openly express their views on that change.</b>

153
00:11:03.916 --> 00:11:06.208
<b>This will have a dual benefit.</b>

154
00:11:06.208 --> 00:11:09.916
<b>The organization will get </b>
<b>new thinking of the youth,</b>

155
00:11:09.916 --> 00:11:11.291
<b>and at the same time,</b>

156
00:11:11.291 --> 00:11:18.125
<b>the diligent youth there will also get the benefit</b>
<b>of the experience of senior colleagues.</b>

157
00:11:18.125 --> 00:11:19.125
<b>From this,</b>

158
00:11:19.125 --> 00:11:21.500
<b>the two generations of the workplace</b>

159
00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:29.541
<b>will learn to work with mutual respect at one level.</b>

160
00:11:29.541 --> 00:11:31.375
<b>Old experience,</b>

161
00:11:31.375 --> 00:11:33.625
<b>and new enthusiasm,</b>

162
00:11:33.625 --> 00:11:39.625
<b>what a beautiful confluence this is </b>
<b>for the progress of an organization.</b>

163
00:11:39.625 --> 00:11:41.083
<b>Think about it.</b>

